```
1. CrisPRO Oncology (For Clinicians) → "From VUS to Validated Care Plan"
2. CrisPRO R&D (For Biotech) → "Design the Undruggable. Validate in Silico."
3. CrisPRO Research (For Academics) → "Accelerate Discovery from Years to Hours"
